abstract: >-
  beal-conjecture v27 port of foundations v0.27-mcom-four-props-inhabited
  at 51bba93. Honest slice Level26/HonestB0Search/ now includes packaged
  theorems Tate/Mazur/Ribet/Kolyvagin displays (Δ, 928/29=32, |SL2|=2184,
  |Sel2|=1, L/Ω=1/3 and 1/7, ¬IsRankZero). Algebraic Tate algorithm /
  Néron, Frey 13-isogeny, abstract Ribet, and Nonempty(Fintype(E(Q)))
  stay def Prop. Vendor unchanged db7a556/fea0c393, no nested Level26,
  path-requires. Matveev C1=143186215390 B0=10^6. Concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22379293. Prior v26 version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22832505
  at 5e2906b / 5806dad. Prior software version v11.0.0
  (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22281075).
